# Revisions listed here are ignored by `git blame` (and by GitHub automatically).
# Use this for large, purely-mechanical commits so blame keeps pointing at the
# real authors of each line.
#
# To use locally, run once:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Append the FULL 40-character commit hash of the one-time clang-format
# repo-wide reformat commit below once it has been made, e.g.:
#   # clang-format: reformat repo
#   0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01234567
